The schemas are included because `build.rs` generates this crate's `schema`
module from them at build time, so the crate cannot be built without them.
Only the ones the implemented features (`net`, `routes`) actually need are
published (`net_file.xsd`, `routes_file.xsd`, `types/base.xsd`,
`types/route.xsd`, `types/taz.xsd`); the repository keeps the full set.

They are not modified here; `build.rs` patches its own copies under
`OUT_DIR` at build time, leaving the originals untouched.

